<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Representing Data using a Frequency Distribution Table</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Thirty customers at a service centre recorded their wait times in minutes as follows:</p>
<p style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd; font-family: monospace; font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.6;">
    {@data_str@}
</p>
<p>Complete the frequency distribution table. In the first column, list each <strong>distinct</strong> wait time in <strong>ascending order</strong> (smallest first); in the second column, write how many times it appears.</p>
<table class="table table-bordered table-striped" style="width: 50%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead style="background-color: #e0e0e0;">
        <tr><th style="text-align: center;">Wait Time (Minutes)</th><th style="text-align: center;">Frequency</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans_v1]] [[validation:ans_v1]] [[feedback:prt_v1]]</td>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans_v2]] [[validation:ans_v2]] [[feedback:prt_v2]]</td>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans_v3]] [[validation:ans_v3]] [[feedback:prt_v3]]</td>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans_v4]] [[validation:ans_v4]] [[feedback:prt_v4]]</td>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans_v5]] [[validation:ans_v5]] [[feedback:prt_v5]]</td>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]] [[feedback:prt5]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans_v6]] [[validation:ans_v6]] [[feedback:prt_v6]]</td>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans6]] [[validation:ans6]] [[feedback:prt6]]</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans_v7]] [[validation:ans_v7]] [[feedback:prt_v7]]</td>
            <td style="text-align:center;">[[input:ans7]] [[validation:ans7]] [[feedback:prt7]]</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h4>Worked solution</h4>
<p>Sorting the distinct wait times in ascending order and counting each one:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>{@v1@}</strong> appears <strong>{@f1@}</strong> times.</li>
<li><strong>{@v2@}</strong> appears <strong>{@f2@}</strong> times.</li>
<li><strong>{@v3@}</strong> appears <strong>{@f3@}</strong> times.</li>
<li><strong>{@v4@}</strong> appears <strong>{@f4@}</strong> times.</li>
<li><strong>{@v5@}</strong> appears <strong>{@f5@}</strong> times.</li>
<li><strong>{@v6@}</strong> appears <strong>{@f6@}</strong> times.</li>
<li><strong>{@v7@}</strong> appears <strong>{@f7@}</strong> times.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Total:</strong> {@f1@}+{@f2@}+{@f3@}+{@f4@}+{@f5@}+{@f6@}+{@f7@} = 30.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
